Feature:
    I want to make sure that the carbon footprint report can be reissued after compensating the event emissions

    Scenario: The results page offers reissuing the report and shows the compensation summary
        Given account "MyCompany" with id "666" exists
        Given user "owner@dediez.software" with role "ROLE_OWNER" of account "666" exists
        Given event "Evento A" with id "333" of account "666" exists
        Given event carbon footprint with id "999" for event "333" of account "666" with breakdown answered exists
        Given event carbon footprint "999" is completed
        Given event carbon footprint "999" has a report generated by "owner@dediez.software"
        Given account "666" compensated "2.5" tonnes of event "333"
        When I am logged as "owner@dediez.software"
        When I go to "/es/events/333/carbon-footprint/step/results"
        Then the response status should be 200
        Then I see a text "Compensación de emisiones"
        Then I see a text "Reemitir informe"
        When I click on link "Reemitir informe"
        Then I am redirected to route "events_carbon_footprint_results"
        Then the report of event carbon footprint "999" should be "pending" keeping its file path

    Scenario: The results page offers retrying the generation when the report failed
        Given account "MyCompany" with id "666" exists
        Given user "owner@dediez.software" with role "ROLE_OWNER" of account "666" exists
        Given event "Evento A" with id "333" of account "666" exists
        Given event carbon footprint with id "999" for event "333" of account "666" with breakdown answered exists
        Given event carbon footprint "999" is completed
        Given event carbon footprint "999" has a failed report by "owner@dediez.software"
        When I am logged as "owner@dediez.software"
        When I go to "/es/events/333/carbon-footprint/step/results"
        Then the response status should be 200
        Then I see a text "No se ha podido generar el informe de esta huella de carbono: Gemini failure"
        Then I see a text "Reintentar generación"
        When I click on link "Reintentar generación"
        Then I am redirected to route "events_carbon_footprint_results"
        Then the report of event carbon footprint "999" should be "pending"
